    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Sequence of Discontinuities (Top to Bottom): Conrad (Crust) -> Mohorovičić (Crust-Mantle) -> Repetti (Mantle) -> Gutenberg (Mantle-Core) -> Lehmann (Core).",
        "The shadow zone of S-waves is larger than that of P-waves because S-waves cannot travel through the liquid outer core.",
        "The asthenosphere (100 km to 400 km) is the upper semi-fluid portion of the mantle that allows tectonic plates to move."
